{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_014wrJ6gkTKJYbjLfifUxPmr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The tests are failing because `draw_card` draws from the library, and the libraries are empty (we used `create_game()` with no decks). The `draw_card` function tries to draw from the library and if it's empty, sets `drawn_from_empty_library = True`. But since `create_game` without args already resets `drawn_from_empty_library`, and we're calling `draw_card` directly on empty libraries, it won't add cards.\n\nI need to either:\n1. Create games with cards in the library so drawing works, or\n2. Populate the library with cards in the tests before attempting to draw\n\nLet me update the tests to include cards in the library when drawing is expected.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1535,"cache_read_input_tokens":121849,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1535},"output_tokens":25,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d92b6c43-7322-4b8d-bfe2-1d1f7f4c24eb","uuid":"86e4f385-eb04-41af-b55a-63d08daaa0a0","request_id":"req_011CbwD2vfx6UU29o8kdtY7K"}
