{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   The user invoked the `execute-todo` skill to implement 10 SOS Magic: The Gathering cards (sos_1, sos_4, sos_13, sos_57, sos_97, sos_120, sos_201, sos_226, sos_245, sos_257) in an existing engine. The task involves: implementing 3 shared engine changes (E1, E2, E3), then implementing each card in dependency order using the correct engine seams (triggers, replacement effects, cast-spell-free, copy-spell, etc.), writing 2–5 real-engine tests per card, and keeping all 1145 engine tests green throughout.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Magic: The Gathering card game engine with typed event system (TriggerManager, ReplacementManager, EffectManager)\n   - Engine seams: `cost_reduction` hook, `cast_spell_free`, `copy_spell`, `register_triggers`, `register_replacement_effects`, `get_activated_abilities`, `get_mana_abilities`, `get_loyalty_abilities`\n   - E1: Firing `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` in `cast_spell` after pushing to stack\n   - E2: `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent` fired from `advance_phase` after `empty_mana_pools()`, so triggers fire at every PRECOMBAT_MAIN regardless of how it's reached\n   - E3: Battlefield cost-reduction aggregation via `spell_cost_reduction(game, spell)` method on permanents, called for instant/sorcery spells by `get_cost_reduction`\n   - Restricted mana: `_restricted_is_mana` dict in ManaPool; only moved to main pool when casting instant/sorcery\n   - `SpellMovesToGraveyardReplacementEvent`: new subclass of `MoveToGraveyardReplacementEvent` with `spell` field, consulted in `_resolve_spell` for non-permanents going to graveyard\n   - Skip turns: `skip_turns` attribute on player, checked and decremented in `advance_phase` end-of-turn logic\n   - `game.rng = random.Random()` added to GameState for deterministic coin flips\n   - Continuous effects: `DURATION_PERMANENT` and `DURATION_END_OF_TURN`, Layer.TYPE for animation, Layer.POWER_TOUGHNESS/MODIFY_PT for pump\n   - `_reset_characteristics` override required for animated Land to reset modified_power/toughness\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n\n   - `/workspace/engine/casting.py`\n     - **E1**: After `game.stack.push(stack_obj)`, fires `SpellCastTriggeredEvent(spell=stack_obj, card=card, controller=player)`\n     - **E3**: `get_cost_reduction` extended to call `spell_cost_reduction(game, card)` on each battlefield permanent for IS spells\n     - **Restricted mana unlock**: Before `can_pay`, if spell is IS and `_restricted_is_mana` non-empty, moves restricted mana into `_pool`; restores on rollback\n     - **_resolve_spell**: For non-permanents going to graveyard, now applies `SpellMovesToGraveyardReplacementEvent` via `game.replacement_manager.apply(...)`, then uses the (possibly redirected) destination zone\n\n   - `/workspace/engine/events.py`\n     - Added: `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent` (fieldless dataclass)\n     - Added: `SpellMovesToGraveyardReplacementEvent(MoveToGraveyardReplacementEvent)` with `spell: Any = None` field and `card` property returning `self.spell`\n\n   - `/workspace/engine/game_state.py`\n     - Added `import random`\n     - Added `self.rng: random.Random = random.Random()` in `__init__`\n     - In `advance_phase`, after `empty_mana_pools()`: fires `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent` when `self.phase == Phase.PRECOMBAT_MAIN`\n     - In end-of-turn logic: checks `skip_turns` attribute on next player; if > 0, decrements and keeps current `active_player_index` (player takes another turn); else normal rotation\n\n   - `/workspace/engine/mana.py`\n     - Added `self._restricted_is_mana: dict[ManaType, int] = {}` to `__init__`\n     - Added `add_restricted(mana_type, amount=1)` method\n     - Modified `empty()` to also call `self._restricted_is_mana.clear()`\n\n   - `/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md` (created)\n     - Logs ambiguity resolutions and deviations from TODO.md\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_4/card_impl.py` (COMPLETE)\n     - Class: `TogetherAsOne(Sorcery)`\n     - `mana_cost=ManaCost(generic=6)`, name=\"Together as One\"\n     - `get_targets`: two TargetRequirements (player, any target)\n     - `on_resolve`: reads `colors_spent`, X = len(set(colors_spent)); draws X for target_player, deals X damage to any_target, gains X life for controller\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_4/tests.py` (COMPLETE)\n     - 4 tests: two-colors=2 effects, colorless=0, five-colors=5, damage to creature\n     - Creates games with 10–20 dummy library cards to support drawing\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_1/card_impl.py` (COMPLETE)\n     - Class: `TheDawningArchaic(Creature)` — {10}, 7/7, Avatar, Legendary, Keyword.REACH\n     - `cost_reduction`: counts instants/sorceries in graveyard\n     - `register_triggers`: AttacksTriggeredEvent → auto-select if 1 target; may cast via `cast_spell_free(..., Zone.GRAVEYARD)`; calls `_register_exile_replacement` before casting\n     - `_register_exile_replacement`: registers `SpellMovesToGraveyardReplacementEvent` replacement that redirects `destination = \"exile\"` (one-shot flag)\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_1/tests.py` (COMPLETE)\n     - 6 tests: cost reduction with 2 instants, empty graveyard, ignores creatures, attack trigger casts and exiles, empty graveyard attack does nothing, reach keyword\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_245/card_impl.py` (COMPLETE)\n     - Class: `WitherbloomTheBalancer(Creature)` — {6}{B}{G}, 5/5, Elder Dragon, Legendary\n     - Keywords: `Keyword.FLYING | Keyword.DEATHTOUCH`\n     - `cost_reduction`: counts creatures controller controls (self affinity)\n     - `spell_cost_reduction(game, spell)`: if spell.controller is self.controller, returns creature count (E3 hook for granting affinity to IS spells)\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py` (COMPLETE)\n     - 6 tests: flying/deathtouch, self affinity (Witherbloom counts itself), 3 extra creatures, E3 grants to instant, only own spells, clamps at generic\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_226/card_impl.py` (COMPLETE)\n     - Class: `SilverquillTheDisputant(Creature)` — {2}{W}{B}, 4/4, Elder Dragon, Legendary\n     - Keywords: `Keyword.FLYING | Keyword.VIGILANCE`\n     - `register_triggers`: SpellCastTriggeredEvent → fires for IS spells by controller (not Silverquill itself); prompts choose_card from candidates+[None]; if chosen and power≥1, sacrifice it, find original SO on stack, copy_spell, push copy\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_226/tests.py` (COMPLETE)\n     - 4 tests: flying/vigilance, casualty fires and creature sacrificed, no casualty without power-1+ creature, player declines with None\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py` (COMPLETE)\n     - Class: `GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex(Land)`\n     - Overrides `_reset_characteristics` to reset modified_power/toughness to base values\n     - `power` and `toughness` properties (for when animated)\n     - `get_mana_abilities()`: two abilities — {T}: Add {C}, and {T}+1life: add_restricted colored mana\n     - `get_activated_abilities()`: {5} animate (gate on `not _animated`): sets base_power=2/base_toughness=4, adds Wizard subtype, calls `_register_animation_effect` (Layer.TYPE permanent ContinuousEffect) and `_register_pump_trigger`\n     - `_register_pump_trigger`: SpellCastTriggeredEvent → if animated and controller cast IS spell → DURATION_END_OF_TURN effect at Layer.POWER_TOUGHNESS/MODIFY_PT doing `land.modified_power += 1`\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/tests.py` (COMPLETE)\n     - 5 tests: basic colorless mana, restricted mana stored in `_restricted_is_mana`, restricted mana usable for instant, animation adds creature type/Wizard/2-4, pump trigger adds +1/+0 per spell (stacking)\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py` (COMPLETE)\n     - Class: `ManaSculpt(Instant)` — {1}{U}{U}\n     - `can_cast`: stack must have other spell\n     - `get_targets`: TargetRequirement for spells on stack\n     - `on_resolve`: counter target spell via `_counter_spell` (mirrors fdn_48); if controller has Wizard → `_register_delayed_mana`\n     - `_counter_spell`: pops from stack._items, moves card to graveyard\n     - `_controls_wizard`: checks subtypes for \"Wizard\"\n     - `_register_delayed_mana`: registers one-shot BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent trigger; condition checks `fired[0]`, `g.active_player is controller`, `g.turn_number > cast_turn`; effect adds {C}×amount\n\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py` (COMPLETE)\n     - 4 tests: counters spell (instant in graveyard), no Wizard no mana, Wizard triggers after 2 full turns, can_cast fails on empty stack\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **sos_4 tests: empty library**: `draw_card` sets `drawn_from_empty_library=True` but doesn't add cards when library is empty. Fixed: create games with 10-20 dummy Instant cards in the library.\n   - **sos_4 test_x_equals_five_max**: 10-card library minus 7 initial draw = 3 left; can't draw 5. Fixed: use n=20.\n   - **sos_1 exile replacement not firing**: `MoveToGraveyardReplacementEvent` only consulted in `move_to_zone` when `leaving_battlefield=True`, but instants move from STACK to GRAVEYARD (not BATTLEFIELD to GRAVEYARD). Fixed: added `SpellMovesToGraveyardReplacementEvent` subclass and modified `_resolve_spell` to apply replacement effects before moving non-permanents to graveyard.\n   - **sos_257 animation lost on apply_all**: `_reset_characteristics` resets `card_types` to original `{LAND}`, stripping CREATURE. Fixed: (1) registered permanent `ContinuousEffect` at `Layer.TYPE` that re-adds CREATURE when `land._animated`; (2) overrode `_reset_characteristics` in `GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex` to reset `modified_power/toughness = base_power/toughness`; pump effect's `modified_power += 1` then correctly accumulates after reset.\n   - **sos_57 delayed mana test wrong turn**: Test advanced to player 1's PRECOMBAT_MAIN (turn 2) when trigger condition requires controller (player 0) to be active. Fixed: advance through two full turns — player 0's turn 1 end → player 1's full turn 2 → player 0's turn 3 PRECOMBAT_MAIN.\n   - **git config missing**: First commit failed with \"Author identity unknown\". Fixed by setting `git config user.email` and `git config user.name`.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - The fundamental challenge of `SpellMovesToGraveyardReplacementEvent` was solved by adding a new subclass to events.py and patching `_resolve_spell` to consult replacement effects for non-permanents.\n   - The sos_257 animation persistence challenge was solved by using the continuous effects layer system properly: permanent Layer.TYPE effect re-applies CREATURE after each reset.\n   - The E2 delayed-mana timing issue in sos_57 was solved by tracking `cast_turn` and requiring `g.turn_number > cast_turn` as a condition.\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - \"Run the `execute-todo` skill now to implement the SOS cards. Your task and prepared execution plan are in /workspace/TODO.md and /workspace/CONTEXT.md.\"\n   - \"CRITICAL: Respond with TEXT ONLY. Do NOT call any tools...\" [summary request]\n   \n   The execute-todo skill also provided detailed instructions within its system prompt, including the per-item loop, restraint principles, and finish criteria.\n\n   Security-relevant constraints (from AGENTS.md and execute-todo skill):\n   - **Never modify `engine_tests/` or `cards/fdn/*/tests.py`** — treat as read-only; modifying these doesn't affect grader score and misleads debugging\n   - **Additive-only engine rule**: Add/edit bodies; never rename, move, or delete existing `engine/` symbols — other modules import by name and a rename/move breaks grader imports\n   - **Card location invariant**: Each card's class must remain in `cards/sos/sos_<N>/card_impl.py`; do not move or rename card directories\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - **sos_120 (Improvisation Capstone)**: Sorcery {5}{R}{R}; exile library until MV≥4; may cast any free; Paradigm — exile self after resolve, then at beginning of each of YOUR first main phases (E2), may cast copy for free. Needs `cast_spell_free` from Zone.EXILE and `copy_spell`.\n   - **sos_13 (Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares)**: Creature {1}{W}{W} // Instant {W}, 3/3 Cat Cleric. ETB → target player creates 1/1 white-black Inkling with flying; then if opponent controls more creatures → becomes prepared. While prepared: may cast copy of Swords to Plowshares (exile creature; controller gains life = its power), which unprepares it. Full name must be `\"Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\"`. Helper SwordsToPlowshares Instant in same file.\n   - **sos_201 (Lorehold, the Historian)**: Creature {3}{R}{W}, 5/5 Elder Dragon. Flying, Haste. Each IS card in hand has miracle {2} (card-local: DrawsCardTriggeredEvent gated on first draw this turn via `player.cards_drawn_this_turn`; may cast for {2} by temporarily setting mana_cost). Opponent's upkeep: may discard→draw.\n   - **sos_97 (Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer)**: Planeswalker {1}{B}{B}, 3 loyalty. +1: Surveil 2 (look top 2, graveyard or keep). −1: Any number of target players each discard. −2: Return creature with MV≤3 from graveyard to battlefield. −7: Flip 5 coins (game.rng); target opponent skips next X turns (skip_turns += X).\n\n8. Current Work:\n   Just completed implementing and testing sos_57 (Mana Sculpt). The last commit was:\n   ```\n   sos_57: Mana Sculpt (counterspell + delayed mana via E2)\n   ```\n   All 1145 engine tests still pass. Six of ten cards are complete: sos_4, sos_1, sos_245, sos_226, sos_257, sos_57.\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Continue with the next item in the build order: **sos_120 (Improvisation Capstone)**. Per TODO.md:\n   > \"- [ ] **sos_120 — Improvisation Capstone** *(cast-from-exile + copy; uses E2 for Paradigm)*\n   >   - Clauses: exile from top of library until total mana value ≥ 4; may cast any number of them for free; Paradigm (after it first resolves, exile it; then at the beginning of each of your first main phases, may cast a copy from exile for free).\n   >   - Reuse: library top access to peel cards (`library.top(n)`; top = last index); `cast_spell_free(..., Zone.EXILE)`; `copy_spell` for the Paradigm copy. Paradigm: on resolve exile the Capstone, then register a recurring trigger on `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent` (E2) for your first main phase.\"\n\n   Implementation approach:\n   - Class `ImprovisationCapstone(Sorcery)` with mana_cost {5}{R}{R}\n   - `on_resolve`: peel from library top until cumulative MV ≥ 4; exile all peeled; let player cast any for free via `cast_spell_free(..., Zone.EXILE)`; then exile self, register recurring E2 trigger\n   - Paradigm trigger: fires each time controller's PRECOMBAT_MAIN begins; create a copy via `copy_spell` (but card is in exile, not on stack — need to create a fresh copy); cast it free\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: /home/node/.claude/projects/-workspace/d92b6c43-7322-4b8d-bfe2-1d1f7f4c24eb.jsonl\nContinue the conversation from where it left off without asking the user any further questions. Resume directly — do not acknowledge the summary, do not recap what was happening, do not preface with \"I'll continue\" or similar. Pick up the last task as if the break never happened."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d92b6c43-7322-4b8d-bfe2-1d1f7f4c24eb","uuid":"92a6befb-0a66-438b-938d-6897b2ac0df6","timestamp":"2026-06-11T09:20:00.477Z","isSynthetic":true}
